{"id":"ugol","lemma":"угол","pos":"noun","rank":1377,"glosses":["corner","angle","dwelling, quarters"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%BB.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%BB.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"угла","plural":"углы"},"examples":[{"text":"Положи его в угол.","en":"Put it in the corner.","words":[{"g":"to put","l":"положить"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Третий дом от угла мой.","en":"The third house from the corner is mine.","words":[{"g":"third"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"from"},null,{"g":"my"}]},{"text":"Он завернул за угол.","en":"He turned the corner.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Этот стул пойдёт в тот угол.","en":"That chair goes in the corner.","words":[{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"chair, seat"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"that one, those ones"},null]},{"text":"У квадрата четыре угла.","en":"A square has four angles.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},null,{"g":"four"},null]}]}